  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_postoffice]": "停用郵局與分揀中心的擬真職場人數計算。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_powerplant]": "停用發電廠的擬真職場人數計算。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_row_homes_apt_per_floor]": "若停用，連棟住宅將使用上方設定的平均每戶平方公尺計算戶數；否則將依指定之每層戶數進行精確計算。（預設：未勾選）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_school]": "停用各級學校的擬真職場教職員人數計算。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_transit]": "停用大眾運輸場站的擬真職場人數計算。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.disable_workplace_calculations]": "停用辦公室、商業與工業分區的擬真職場人數計算，職缺數將恢復為原版預設值。需重新啟動遊戲。（預設：未勾選）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.electricity_consumption_reduction]": "降低建築用電量以補償住戶或員工激增造成的電力消耗暴增。遊戲中用電量與人數直接掛鉤，因此本模組會使建築耗電顯著增加。（預設：20）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.evicted_reset_type]": "選擇重新計算後遭驅離家庭的處理方式：可選擇讓其在城市中尋找新家，或直接將其刪除。（預設：尋找新住處）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.fire_sqm_per_worker]": "消防局每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：50）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.garbage_sqm_per_worker]": "垃圾處理設施每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：95）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.hh_spawn_speed_rate]": "影響新家庭生成的速率係數。數值越低代表生成越快、家庭越多。原版數值為 0.5。（預設：0.5）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.hospital_sqm_per_patient]": "醫院：每位病患佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，醫院病床收容容量越少。（預設：50）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.hospital_sqm_per_worker]": "醫院：每位醫護/員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，醫院員工數量越少。（預設：100）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.increase_power_production]": "若發電廠員工數相較於原版有所增加，則依比例提升其發電量；若員工數減少，則發電量維持不變。（預設：未勾選）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.industry_area_base]": "針對佔地面積超過此門檻的大型工業廠區，套用折減係數以避免產生過度誇張的龐大職缺數。（預設：7000）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.industry_avg_floor_height]": "工業建築平均樓層高度（公尺）。（預設：4.5）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.industry_sqm_per_worker]": "工業廠房每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：50）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.noise_factor]": "縮放建築物產生的噪音。100% = 原版噪音；0% = 完全無噪音。例如 25% 代表建築僅產生原版 25% 的噪音（降噪 75%）。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.office_elevators_per_sqm]": "每設置一部電梯所需的總樓地板面積。該數值用於計算大樓內的電梯數量，電梯佔用面積將從可供員工使用的空間中扣除。（預設：4180）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.office_height_base]": "針對總樓層數高於此門檻的超高摩天大樓，套用折減係數以扣減計算出的總職缺數量。（預設：60）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.office_non_usable_space]": "辦公大樓中不可用公共空間的百分比（如走廊、會議室、收發室等，不含電梯與樓梯空間）。（預設：20）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.office_sqm_per_worker]": "辦公室每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：23）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.pack_MedHigh]": "套用於英國 (UK) 資產包中高密度住宅的戶數乘數。1.00 = 預設，小於 1 減少戶數，大於 1 增加戶數。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.pack_choice]": "選擇欲調整加權參數的創作者資產包。（預設：法國 France）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.pack_low]": "套用於所選資產包低密度住宅的戶數乘數。1.00 = 預設，小於 1 減少戶數，大於 1 增加戶數。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.pack_row_homes]": "套用於所選資產包連棟住宅的戶數乘數。1.00 = 預設，小於 1 減少戶數，大於 1 增加戶數。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.park_sqm_per_worker]": "公園與遊憩設施每位維護人員佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：80）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.police_sqm_per_worker]": "警察局每位警務人員佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：50）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.port_sqm_per_worker]": "港口與碼頭設施每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：120）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.postoffice_sqm_per_worker]": "郵局與分揀設施每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：46）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.powerplant_employees_per_gw]": "發電廠每 GW 發電容量配置的員工數量。僅在啟用「改依每 GW 裝置容量計算員工數」時生效。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.powerplant_sqm_per_worker]": "發電廠每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：200）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.powerplant_use_employees_per_gw]": "若勾選，發電廠員工數將改用下方「每 GW 員工數」進行計算；若未勾選，則依廠房面積計算。",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.prison_non_usable_space]": "監獄建築中非牢房生活設施佔用的空間百分比（包括走道、食堂、醫務室、辦公室等）。（預設：40）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.prison_sqm_per_prisoner]": "每位受刑人佔用的牢房平方公尺面積。數值越高，受刑人收容人數越少。（預設：4）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.prisoners_per_officer]": "每位戒護管理警員對應看管的受刑人數，用於精確計算監獄所需配置的警力職缺。（預設：4）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.rent_discount]": "由於戶數變更可能導致租金劇烈上漲，可使用此設定給予租金折扣補貼，以抑制市民因高租金而遷出。（預設：20）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_avg_floor_height]": "住宅建築的平均樓層高度（公尺）。（預設：3）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_hallway_space]": "樓層走廊等公設空間所佔的樓地板面積百分比（不包含電梯與樓梯空間）。（預設：10）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_l4_reduction]": "等級 4 住宅相對於平均住宅面積的擴大幅度（大坪數導致戶數減少）。（預設：10）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_l5_reduction]": "等級 5 奢華住宅相對於平均住宅面積的擴大幅度（超大坪數豪宅）。（預設：20）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_lowdensity_sqm_per_apartment]": "低密度住宅每戶平均擁有的平方公尺面積。（預設：150）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_lowrent_sqm_per_apartment]": "低租金住宅每戶平均平方公尺面積。（預設：70）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_sqm_per_apartment]": "中高密度公寓每戶平均平方公尺面積。（預設：90）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_units_per_elevator]": "大樓每設置一部電梯所服務的公寓戶數。電梯佔用面積將自建築可住面積中扣除。（預設：70）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.residential_vacancy_rate]": "保留給城市本地市民遷徙更換住所的住宅空置率百分比。（預設：5）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.results_reduction]": "將所有計算出的職場與住宅結果依此百分比全域折減。注意部分建築保底需有 1 個員工或住戶，不受折減。（預設：0）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.rowhomes_apt_per_floor]": "連棟住宅建築每層規劃的住戶數量。（預設：1）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.rowhomes_basement]": "若設為勾選，連棟住宅將額外計算一層地下室空間。（預設：勾選）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.service_upkeep_reduction]": "降低公共服務設施的維護費用比例，用以補償因員工激增帶來的額外財政支出。（預設：70）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.shared_single_family_home_rate]": "符合資格之大型單戶獨棟住宅額外容納第二戶家庭的機率。超大型豪宅更有極小機率入住第三戶。（預設：10）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.single_household_low_density]": "若勾選，低密度獨棟別墅住宅將嚴格限制僅能居住單一家庭。（預設：勾選）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.solarpowerplant_reduction_factor]": "太陽能發電廠的計算員工數折減倍率（太陽能自動化程度高，所需員工少）。（預設：5）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.sqm_college_adjuster]": "套用於學院設施之每位學生基礎面積的乘數加成。（預設：3）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.sqm_per_student]": "每位學生在校舍所需的基礎活動空間面積，用於換算學校招生容量。（預設：7）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.sqm_univ_adjuster]": "套用於大學設施之每位學生基礎面積的乘數加成。（預設：4）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.students_per_teacher]": "師生比（每位專任教師對應之學生數），用於計算學校所需的教師職員數量。（預設：14）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.support_staff]": "學校教職員工中非專任教師的行政/後勤輔助人員比例。（預設：30）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.transit_station_sqm_per_worker]": "大眾運輸站點每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：40）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.warehouse_sqm_per_worker]": "倉儲物流建築每位員工佔用的平方公尺面積。數值越高，員工數量越少。（預設：300）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.water_consumption_reduction]": "降低建築用水量以補償人數暴增帶來的供水吃緊。建築用水量與住戶或員工數直接相關。（預設：20）",
  "Options.OPTION_DESCRIPTION[RWH.RealisticWorkplacesAndHouseholds.Mod.Setting.zero_park_and_parking_workers]": "啟用時，公園與露天停車場將配置 0 名員工，直接覆蓋原本的公園員工公式計算。",
